<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>四级考试时间/流程</title>
<script>
window.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] } };
</script>
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js" async></script>
<style>
  body {
    background-color: #f0f4fa;
    background-image: linear-gradient(#dbe4f0 1px, transparent 1px),
                       linear-gradient(90deg, #dbe4f0 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 20px 20px;
    font-family: "Microsoft YaHei", "SimHei", sans-serif;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 15px 25px;
    color: #222;
    font-size: 13px;
  }

  .title-banner {
    background: linear-gradient(#eaf1fb, #d7e6fa);
    border: 2px solid #2f6fb0;
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 10px 20px;
    max-width: 520px;
    margin: 0 auto 18px auto;
    box-shadow: 2px 2px 0px #b9cde8;
  }
  .title-banner h1 {
    margin: 0;
    text-align: center;
    color: #1f4f8f;
    font-size: 26px;
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }
  .title-banner h1 .num-box {
    display: inline-block;
    background: #2f6fb0;
    color: #fff;
    padding: 2px 8px;
    margin-right: 6px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    font-size: 22px;
  }

  table.exam-table {
    border-collapse: collapse;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 560px;
    margin: 0 auto 22px auto;
    background: #fff;
    font-size: 13px;
  }
  table.exam-table th, table.exam-table td {
    border: 1px solid #7fa8d9;
    padding: 5px 8px;
    text-align: left;
  }
  table.exam-table th {
    background: #e9f0fb;
    color: #1f4f8f;
    text-align: center;
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  table.exam-table td.center {
    text-align: center;
  }
  .red-bold {
    color: #c0392b;
    font-weight: bold;
  }

  .content-columns {
    display: flex;
    max-width: 560px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    gap: 8px;
    position: relative;
  }
  .column {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 0;
  }
  .arrow-col {
    width: 18px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    padding-top: 40px;
    color: #333;
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  .block {
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .block-header {
    font-weight: bold;
    padding: 2px 4px;
    margin-bottom: 2px;
    display: inline-block;
  }
  .block-header.highlight {
    background-color: #fff45c;
  }
  .block p, .block ol, .block ul {
    margin: 2px 0 2px 0;
    padding-left: 18px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .block p {
    padding-left: 0;
  }
  .block ol, .block ul {
    list-style-position: outside;
  }
  .circ-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding-left: 0;
    margin: 2px 0;
  }
  .circ-list li {
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .hl-inline {
    background-color: #fff45c;
  }
  .bullet-dot {
    color: #333;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="title-banner">
    <h1><span class="num-box">一、</span>四级考试时间/流程</h1>
  </div>

  <table class="exam-table">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>试卷结构</th>
        <th>测试内容</th>
        <th>测试题型</th>
        <th>分值占比</th>
        <th>考试时长</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td class="center">作文</td>
        <td>作文</td>
        <td>短文写作</td>
        <td class="center">15%</td>
        <td class="center red-bold">30分钟</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="center" rowspan="3">听力</td>
        <td>短篇阅读3段</td>
        <td>选择题（单选）</td>
        <td class="center">7%</td>
        <td class="center red-bold" rowspan="3">25分钟</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>长对话2篇</td>
        <td>选择题（单选）</td>
        <td class="center">8%</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>听力篇章3篇</td>
        <td>选择题（单选）</td>
        <td class="center">20%</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="center" rowspan="3">阅读理解</td>
        <td>词汇理解</td>
        <td>选词填空</td>
        <td class="center">5%</td>
        <td class="center red-bold" rowspan="3">40分钟</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>长篇阅读</td>
        <td>匹配</td>
        <td class="center">10%</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>仔细阅读</td>
        <td>选择题（单选）</td>
        <td class="center">20%</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="center">翻译</td>
        <td>汉译英</td>
        <td>段落翻译</td>
        <td class="center">15%</td>
        <td class="center red-bold">30分钟</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="center">总计</td>
        <td></td>
        <td></td>
        <td class="center">100%</td>
        <td class="center">125分钟</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <div class="content-columns">
    <div class="column left-col">

      <div class="block">
        <span class="block-header">● 8:40 考生入场</span>
        <ol>
          <li>出示准考证、身份证、学生证。</li>
          <li>手机严禁带入考场。</li>
          <li>入座后请调试耳机听。</li>
        </ol>
        <p>①证件不齐者严禁入场，不能参加考试。</p>
        <p>②核对好你的照片，开考后不再试。</p>
      </div>

      <div class="block">
        <span class="block-header highlight">● 9:00 下发考试材料</span>
        <ol>
          <li>检查试题册、条形码、答题卡的印刷质量。</li>
          <li>阅读试题册正面"敬告考生"内容</li>
          <li>贴条形码、填写个人信息。</li>
        </ol>
        <p>①非听力考试期间不得佩戴耳机，
        且不得提前翻试题册，违规处理。</p>
        <p>②在文题目在试题册背面，
        使用黑色签字笔在<span class="hl-inline">答题卡1</span>上作答。</p>
      </div>

      <div class="block">
        <span class="block-header highlight">● 9:10 考试正式开始</span>
        <p>开始你的答作文。30分钟。</p>
        <p>之后将立即进行听力考试。</p>
      </div>

      <div class="block">
        <span class="block-header">● 9:35 提示考生</span>
        <p>监考老师口头提醒，5分钟后开始听力考试。</p>
      </div>

    </div>

    <div class="arrow-col">➤</div>

    <div class="column right-col">

      <div class="block">
        <span class="block-header highlight">● 9:40 听力考试开始</span>
        <ol>
          <li>打开试题册，戴上耳机。</li>
          <li>进行听力考试。</li>
        </ol>
        <p>听力考试时间为25分钟，
        请考生掌握好答题卡1的填涂时间，</p>
        <p class="hl-inline">听力录音播放完毕后，将立即回收答题卡1。</p>
      </div>

      <div class="block">
        <span class="block-header highlight">● 10:05 听力考试结束</span>
        <p>停止作答，摘下耳机。</p>
        <p>考试暂停5分钟，等待收题卡1。</p>
      </div>

      <div class="block">
        <span class="block-header highlight">● 10:10 命令考生继续作答</span>
        <p>作答阅读理解和翻译部分。</p>
        <p>监考老师口头提醒。</p>
      </div>

      <div class="block">
        <span class="block-header">● 11:10 提示考生</span>
        <p>继续作答，掌握好时间。</p>
        <p>监考老师提醒，10分钟后考试将结束。</p>
      </div>

      <div class="block">
        <span class="block-header highlight">● 11:20 考试结束</span>
        <p>考生停止作答。</p>
        <p>①考生交回试题册、答题卡2。</p>
        <p>②监考老师清点无误后考生方可离场。</p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>

</body>
</html>
```
